---
import { Star } from "lucide-react";

const reviews = [
  {
    name: "Jessica Pierre",
    role: "Parent · CE1",
    image: "https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Jessica+Pierre&background=2657ee&color=fff&size=200",
    content:
      "L'attention personnalisée dont bénéficie mon fils est remarquable. Sa confiance en mathématiques a fait un bond spectaculaire en un seul semestre.",
  },
  {
    name: "David Joseph",
    role: "Parent · Maternelle",
    image: "https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=David+Joseph&background=0b1220&color=fff&size=200",
    content:
      "Trouver une école qui valorise autant la créativité que les études était notre priorité. ISAJ a dépassé toutes nos attentes.",
  },
];
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-16 max-w-2xl">
      <p class="mb-4 text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-ink-mute">
        La voix des familles
      </p>
      <h2 class="tracking-headline balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-ink md:text-[3.25rem]">
        Apprécié des <span class="font-display italic font-normal text-brand-deep">familles</span> qui nous font confiance
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      {
        reviews.map((r) => (
          <figure class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[1.75rem] border border-black/[0.06] bg-white p-9 md:p-11">
            {/* Decorative serif quote mark */}
            <span class="font-display absolute top-7 right-9 select-none text-[5rem] leading-none text-brand/20" aria-hidden="true">
              "
            </span>

            <div class="flex gap-0.5">
              {[...Array(5)].map(() => (
                <Star size={13} className="fill-amber-400 text-amber-400" />
              ))}
            </div>

            <blockquote class="mt-6 font-display text-[1.5rem] font-normal leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink md:text-[1.65rem]">
              <span class="italic">"</span>{r.content}<span class="italic">"</span>
            </blockquote>

            <figcaption class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-black/[0.06] pt-6">
              <img
                src={r.image}
                alt={r.name}
                width="44"
                height="44"
                class="h-11 w-11 rounded-full object-cover"
              />
              <div>
                <p class="text-[0.95rem] font-medium text-ink">{r.name}</p>
                <p class="text-[0.78rem] text-ink-mute">{r.role}</p>
              </div>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
